  "description": "Screenshot reproduction: two Nexus peers, Po1 on Ethernet1/27-28, routed Ethernet1/29 keepalive, no downstream vPC members. Default-management VRF failure, default/dedicated VRF repairs and native-compatible range switchport reapplication. CML uses Ethernet1/1-3 mapped to NetworkSim Ethernet1/27-29; the first 30-NIC native attempt was stopped before it reached a usable CLI.",
